        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite </strong>None of the PCs (or their companions) have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying} condition.</p><p><strong>Effect </strong>The Automagical Mine Cart moves 30 feet forward along the minecart tracks. Any creatures or objects in the path are pushed out of the way harmlessly.</p><hr /><p>Outside of combat, the Cart moves consistently along the tracks at 30 feet per round (as long as no PCs are Dying). Players cannot ride in the cart, the ore they're transporting is too delicate and reactive. </p><p><strong>Note: </strong>You can reduce the cart's speed to 20 feed per round if your PCs are particularly slow (ie: Tier 1 dwarves with full plate). </p>"
        },
